{"id":"59f9df438acba46e","group":"72","path":"72/72-thm-cut-elimination-quantitative.md","title":"Quantitative Cut Elimination","display":"thm-cut-elimination-quantitative — Quantitative Cut Elimination","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Handbook of Proof Theory","book_abbrev":"72","label":"72-thm-cut-elimination-quantitative","aliases":["72-thm-cut-elimination-quantitative"],"display":"thm-cut-elimination-quantitative — Quantitative Cut Elimination","depends_on":["[[72-df-strong-inference-size]]","[[72-df-cut-degree]]"],"chapter":"I","source_edition":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998","source_location":"Ch.I Theorem2.4.2 and Lemma2.4.2.2, print37,41/PDF49,53; size convention §1.2.5 print13/PDF25; source theorem plus separate local finite-maximum lemma","verification_status":"source-tower-bound-and-size-convention-checked; local representation correspondence reviewed; not-machine-checked","eligible_as_verified_dependency":false,"revision_2026_10_22":"补出最坏情形界对输入长度和切度阈值的单调性","review_2026_10_23":"消除旧附式与新源定理的文字指代歧义，并保留证明资格限制","proof_status":"source proof read; named-variable translation and distinct local maximum lemma recorded; not machine verified"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Handbook of Proof Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"72"},{"key":"label","html":"72-thm-cut-elimination-quantitative"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>72-thm-cut-elimination-quantitative</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-cut-elimination-quantitative — Quantitative Cut Elimination"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"16df0c25397b1f80\" href=\"?note=16df0c25397b1f80\" title=\"72-df-strong-inference-size\">72-df-strong-inference-size</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"715dbcdaf4fc3a32\" href=\"?note=715dbcdaf4fc3a32\" title=\"72-df-cut-degree\">72-df-cut-degree</a></span></div>"},{"key":"chapter","html":"I"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"Buss (ed.), Handbook of Proof Theory, Elsevier, 1998"},{"key":"source_location","html":"Ch.I Theorem2.4.2 and Lemma2.4.2.2, print37,41/PDF49,53; size convention §1.2.5 print13/PDF25; source theorem plus separate local finite-maximum lemma"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-tower-bound-and-size-convention-checked; local representation correspondence reviewed; not-machine-checked"},{"key":"eligible_as_verified_dependency","html":"false"},{"key":"revision_2026_10_22","html":"补出最坏情形界对输入长度和切度阈值的单调性"},{"key":"review_2026_10_23","html":"消除旧附式与新源定理的文字指代歧义，并保留证明资格限制"},{"key":"proof_status","html":"source proof read; named-variable translation and distinct local maximum lemma recorded; not machine verified"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(E\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span> 是可判定的合法输入证明编码集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_0\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\">\\(E_0\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*\\)</span> 是无切输出编码集；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"c:E\\cup E_0\\to Q\">\\(c:E\\cup E_0\\to Q\\)</span> 为结论函数。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_E:E\\to\\omega\">\\(d_E:E\\to\\omega\\)</span> 是总可计算的切度函数，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CE}:E\\to E_0\">\\(\\mathrm{CE}:E\\to E_0\\)</span> 是总可计算函数且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\rho\\in E\\ (c(\\mathrm{CE}(\\rho))=c(\\rho))\">\\(\\forall\\rho\\in E\\ (c(\\mathrm{CE}(\\rho))=c(\\rho))\\)</span>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"|\\rho|\">\\(|\\rho|\\)</span> 始终表示二进制编码长度。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n,k\\in\\omega\">\\(n,k\\in\\omega\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"F_{E,d_E,\\mathrm{CE}}\">\\(F_{E,d_E,\\mathrm{CE}}\\)</span> 由下式定义。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n&#39;,k&#39;\\in\\omega\">\\(n&#39;,k&#39;\\in\\omega\\)</span>；两个阈值仍针对同一 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,d_E,\\mathrm{CE}\">\\(E,d_E,\\mathrm{CE}\\)</span>，不在比较时改变编码或算法。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p>源定理分支中 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi\\in\\mathcal B_\\Sigma\">\\(\\pi\\in\\mathcal B_\\Sigma\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\\in\\omega\">\\(d\\in\\omega\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{CutDeg}(\\pi)\\le d+1\">\\(\\operatorname{CutDeg}(\\pi)\\le d+1\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BussSize}\">\\(\\operatorname{BussSize}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal B_\\Sigma,\\mathcal B^0_\\Sigma\">\\(\\mathcal B_\\Sigma,\\mathcal B^0_\\Sigma\\)</span> 取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"16df0c25397b1f80\" href=\"?note=16df0c25397b1f80\" title=\"72-df-strong-inference-size\">72-df-strong-inference-size</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tow}:\\omega^2\\to\\omega\">\\(\\operatorname{Tow}:\\omega^2\\to\\omega\\)</span> 由下式自然数递归引入。该分支与原有编码参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E,d_E:E\\to\\omega\">\\(E,d_E:E\\to\\omega\\)</span> 分开：后者的函数切度现记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d_E\">\\(d_E\\)</span>，不能与自然数 d 混作同一输入。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tow}(0,n):=n,\\qquad\\operatorname{Tow}(i+1,n):=2^{\\operatorname{Tow}(i,n)}\\quad(i,n\\in\\omega).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Tow}(0,n):=n,\\qquad\\operatorname{Tow}(i+1,n):=2^{\\operatorname{Tow}(i,n)}\\quad(i,n\\in\\omega).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathcal B_\\Sigma\\ \\forall d\\in\\omega\\quad\n\\operatorname{CutDeg}(\\pi)\\le d+1\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\pi^*\\in\\mathcal B^0_\\Sigma\\\n\\bigl[\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi^*)=\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)\\land\n\\operatorname{BussSize}(\\pi^*)&lt;\\operatorname{Tow}(2d+2,\\operatorname{BussSize}(\\pi))\\bigr].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathcal B_\\Sigma\\ \\forall d\\in\\omega\\quad\n\\operatorname{CutDeg}(\\pi)\\le d+1\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\pi^*\\in\\mathcal B^0_\\Sigma\\\n\\bigl[\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi^*)=\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)\\land\n\\operatorname{BussSize}(\\pi^*)&lt;\\operatorname{Tow}(2d+2,\\operatorname{BussSize}(\\pi))\\bigr].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"F_{E,d_E,\\mathrm{CE}}(n,k)\\coloneqq\\max\\left(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{|\\mathrm{CE}(\\rho)|:\\rho\\in E\\land|\\rho|\\le n\\land d_E(\\rho)\\le k\\}\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[F_{E,d_E,\\mathrm{CE}}(n,k)\\coloneqq\\max\\left(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{|\\mathrm{CE}(\\rho)|:\\rho\\in E\\land|\\rho|\\le n\\land d_E(\\rho)\\le k\\}\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\pi\\in E\\ \\left(\\mathrm{CE}(\\pi)\\in E_0\\land c(\\mathrm{CE}(\\pi))=c(\\pi)\\land|\\mathrm{CE}(\\pi)|\\le F_{E,d_E,\\mathrm{CE}}(|\\pi|,d_E(\\pi))\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall\\pi\\in E\\ \\left(\\mathrm{CE}(\\pi)\\in E_0\\land c(\\mathrm{CE}(\\pi))=c(\\pi)\\land|\\mathrm{CE}(\\pi)|\\le F_{E,d_E,\\mathrm{CE}}(|\\pi|,d_E(\\pi))\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"n\\le n&#39;\\land k\\le k&#39;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ F_{E,d_E,\\mathrm{CE}}(n,k)\\le F_{E,d_E,\\mathrm{CE}}(n&#39;,k&#39;).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[n\\le n&#39;\\land k\\le k&#39;\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ F_{E,d_E,\\mathrm{CE}}(n,k)\\le F_{E,d_E,\\mathrm{CE}}(n&#39;,k&#39;).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>本地条件性推导，背景为第 I 章 §2.4，印刷 pp.36–42 / PDF pp.48–54。长度不超过 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\">\\(n\\)</span> 的二进制串有限；逐个判定是否属于 E，再对满足切度界的串运行已假定总的 CE，即可计算显示的最大值。输入 π 自身属于该有限集合，故不等式成立。</p>\n<p>上述有限最大值附式证明的是已给出总切消算法时存在可计算最坏情形界；该附式本身没有构造或证明 CE 的终止，也不作为原书 Theorem 2.4.2 的具体塔式界。旧式混淆了节点数与编码长度，并含损坏的 operatorname 宏；二者均已修订。</p>\n<p>阈值增加只扩大取最大值的有限候选集合，故新单调性式成立。有限最大值附式仍是参数固定的算法最坏界；具体塔式消切界另由本节前两式记录。</p>\n<p>2026-10-23：原书print37/PDF49页图给出的界为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2_{2d+2}^{\\|P\\|}\">\\(2_{2d+2}^{\\|P\\|}\\)</span>，不是二进制编码长度的界。新增 Tow 和强推理计数给出实际非条件性存在定理。输入先以零强推理成本规整绑定名、自由/本征变量；上下文分裂与共享版本以弱化、收缩、交换互译，不增加强推理。对规整后的原子初始证明应用书中 Lemma2.4.2.2 逐层降低最大切深，译回时仅需α改名。原始任意公式初始式必须先展开并重算输入大小，不能直接代入本式。完整来源证明已读到各主切分支及逐层估计；未作机器证明，亦未把一般编码的旧附式当成该源定理的证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"72-df-strong-inference-size","status":"resolved","id":"16df0c25397b1f80","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-strong-inference-size]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-cut-degree","status":"resolved","id":"715dbcdaf4fc3a32","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[72-df-cut-degree]]","embed":false},{"target":"72-df-strong-inference-size","status":"resolved","id":"16df0c25397b1f80","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"源定理分支中 $\\pi\\in\\mathcal B_\\Sigma$，$d\\in\\omega$ 且 $\\operatorname{CutDeg}(\\pi)\\le d+1$；$\\operatorname{BussSize}$、$\\mathcal B_\\Sigma,\\mathcal B^0_\\Sigma$ 取 [[72-df-strong-inference-size]]。$\\operatorname{Tow}:\\omega^2\\to\\omega$ 由下式自然数递归引入。该分支与原有编码参数 $E,d_E:E\\to\\omega$ 分开：后者的函数切度现记 $d_E$，不能与自然数 d 混作同一输入。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"E\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"E_0\\subseteq\\{0,1\\}^*","display":false},{"tex":"c:E\\cup E_0\\to Q","display":false},{"tex":"d_E:E\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CE}:E\\to E_0","display":false},{"tex":"\\forall\\rho\\in E\\ (c(\\mathrm{CE}(\\rho))=c(\\rho))","display":false},{"tex":"|\\rho|","display":false},{"tex":"n,k\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"F_{E,d_E,\\mathrm{CE}}","display":false},{"tex":"n',k'\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"E,d_E,\\mathrm{CE}","display":false},{"tex":"\\pi\\in\\mathcal B_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"d\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{CutDeg}(\\pi)\\le d+1","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{BussSize}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal B_\\Sigma,\\mathcal B^0_\\Sigma","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Tow}:\\omega^2\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"E,d_E:E\\to\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"d_E","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Tow}(0,n):=n,\\qquad\\operatorname{Tow}(i+1,n):=2^{\\operatorname{Tow}(i,n)}\\quad(i,n\\in\\omega).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\pi\\in\\mathcal B_\\Sigma\\ \\forall d\\in\\omega\\quad\n\\operatorname{CutDeg}(\\pi)\\le d+1\\ \\Longrightarrow\\\n\\exists\\pi^*\\in\\mathcal B^0_\\Sigma\\\n\\bigl[\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi^*)=\\operatorname{Concl}(\\pi)\\land\n\\operatorname{BussSize}(\\pi^*)<\\operatorname{Tow}(2d+2,\\operatorname{BussSize}(\\pi))\\bigr].","display":true},{"tex":"F_{E,d_E,\\mathrm{CE}}(n,k)\\coloneqq\\max\\left(\\{0\\}\\cup\\{|\\mathrm{CE}(\\rho)|:\\rho\\in E\\land|\\rho|\\le n\\land d_E(\\rho)\\le k\\}\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\pi\\in E\\ \\left(\\mathrm{CE}(\\pi)\\in E_0\\land c(\\mathrm{CE}(\\pi))=c(\\pi)\\land|\\mathrm{CE}(\\pi)|\\le F_{E,d_E,\\mathrm{CE}}(|\\pi|,d_E(\\pi))\\right).","display":true},{"tex":"n\\le n'\\land k\\le k'\\ \\Longrightarrow\\ F_{E,d_E,\\mathrm{CE}}(n,k)\\le F_{E,d_E,\\mathrm{CE}}(n',k').","display":true},{"tex":"n","display":false},{"tex":"2_{2d+2}^{\\|P\\|}","display":false}],"bytes":4441,"backlinks":[{"id":"4d85a6a31705a214","anchor":"ref-197","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[./72-thm-cut-elimination-quantitative|thm-cut-elimination-quantitative — Quantitative Cut Elimination]]"}],"outgoing":["16df0c25397b1f80","715dbcdaf4fc3a32"]}